      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are a growth strategist and content researcher for an AI automation solutions company.\n\nYour goal is to generate ONE high-converting content topic and perform deep research on it so it can be directly used for blog and social media content.\n\n---\n\nCONTEXT:\n\nBusiness Services:\n- AI automation\n- Lead management systems\n- Chatbots (WhatsApp, website, Telegram)\n- Voice AI (call automation)\n\nTarget Audience:\n- Business owners\n- Sales teams\n- Customer support teams\n\n---\n\nTASK:\n\nStep 1: Generate 3 potential high-converting topics  \nStep 2: Evaluate them based on:\n- revenue impact\n- urgency\n- likelihood of starting conversation\n\nStep 3: Select the one BEST topic  \nStep 4: Perform detailed research on the selected topic\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON):\n\n{\n  \"topic_title\": \"\",\n  \"topic_keyword\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"conversion\",\n  \"recommended_platform\": \"\",\n  \"target_problem\": \"\",\n  \"cta_angle\": \"\",\n\n  \"research\": {\n    \"problem_explanation\": \"\",\n    \"why_it_happens\": \"\",\n    \"business_impact\": \"\",\n    \"current_wrong_solutions\": \"\",\n    \"automation_solution\": \"\",\n    \"real_world_example\": \"\",\n    \"key_benefits\": [\n      \"\",\n      \"\"\n    ],\n    \"objections_users_may_have\": [\n      \"\",\n      \"\"\n    ],\n    \"content_angles\": [\n      \"\",\n      \"\"\n    ]\n  }\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
